// The same program as tests/modules/app, importing the same package as a
// dotted path: a module path folded onto the dots Teyru's import syntax is
// written with. Both spellings have to reach the same package, and every
// import path in these fixtures is written one way or the other so that a
// build that only understands one of them fails here.
import example.com.greeting.text

class Main {
  public static void main(String[] args) {
    System.out.println(Text.shout("teyru"))
  }
}
